#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Fetch/Fetching/Fetching.cpp (lines 932-1193): scheme fetch,
#       for about:blank, blob: (FileAPI's blob URL store is phase 3: its calls trap), data:,
#       file: and resource: (Ladybird's ad-hoc network fetch through the ResourceLoader, for
#       subresources of file: and resource: pages) and HTTP(S) (HTTP fetch, fetching_5).
